# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# D-HRM — Root .gitignore
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Secrets / Environment Variables ─────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Keep example templates
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# ── IDE / Editor ─────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.suo
*.user
*.swp
*.swo
.project
.classpath
.settings/

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Java / Maven ─────────────────────────────
**/target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar

# ── Node / Frontend ───────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.cache/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
**/logs/

# ── Test & Coverage ───────────────────────────
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
surefire-reports/

# ── Local Resources (private assets) ─────────
/resources/